# Review is required on the paths where a mistake is expensive and invisible in a diff.
#
# The schema is the contract every other layer is written against (ADR-001); the ingestion pipeline
# handles untrusted files from the open internet and shells out to LibreOffice and Tesseract; the
# render path is the one that has already shipped a production 500; and privacy and logging are where
# a CV's contents could leak.
/src/schema/            @eddremonts86
/src/ingest/            @eddremonts86
/src/render/            @eddremonts86
/src/lib/log.ts         @eddremonts86
/src/routes/api/        @eddremonts86
/Dockerfile             @eddremonts86
/.github/workflows/     @eddremonts86
/.githooks/             @eddremonts86
